The 3 questions every Japanese convenience store clerk asks you 🏪
Learn the answers once, use them forever.

Today's phrases:
• あたためますか (atatamemasu ka) = Would you like it heated?
• おはし (ohashi) = Chopsticks
• いりません (irimasen) = I don't need it

